From 42dbede670b514349341fdefee6e1bcac8c1b4ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Riaz <riaz@riazcomputer.dev>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 19:34:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Student list: collapse per-row action buttons into a dropdown
 menu

The row of 5-8 inline buttons per student looked cluttered. Replaced
it with a single 'Actions' dropdown button per row (Bootstrap
dropdown, already loaded via base.html) that reveals the same set of
links (Details, Edit, Test/Marksheet, ID Card, Issue TC, Discontinue,
Certificates, SSC, Delete) on click. No functional change -- same
permission checks and same links, just tucked behind one button
instead of spread across the row. Delete is separated with a divider
and shown in red as it's the destructive action.
---
 .../templates/students/student_list.html      | 66 ++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 35 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)

diff --git a/school_system/templates/students/student_list.html b/school_system/templates/students/student_list.html
index e4bbcf6..e1e4e8e 100644
--- a/school_system/templates/students/student_list.html
+++ b/school_system/templates/students/student_list.html
@@ -23,8 +23,6 @@
     .students-table tr.dup-possible { background: #fffdf3; }
     .students-table .name-cell { font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); }
     .students-table .id-cell { font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #6c757d; white-space: nowrap; }
-    .students-table .actions-cell { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
-    .students-table .actions-cell .btn { flex: 0 0 auto; }
     .students-table-empty { text-align: center; color: #6c757d; padding: 48px 16px; }
     .print-table-wrapper { display: none; }
     @media print {
@@ -175,43 +173,49 @@
